{"id":52929,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=52929"},"modified":"2026-09-29T10:58:35","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T09:58:35","slug":"trilhos-do-burel","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-do-burel\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos do Burel 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos do Burel 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Trilhos do Burel 2026<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realizam-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), no emblem\u00e1tico concelho de <strong>Manteigas<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Serra da Estrela<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. Criado com o prop\u00f3sito de valorizar o deslumbrante Vale da Castanheira e as tradi\u00e7\u00f5es serranas, o evento proporciona uma imers\u00e3o profunda na natureza de montanha.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa divide-se em quatro desafios: a exigente prova rainha <strong>Trilhos do Burel 33K<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:05 com tempo limite de 7 horas), <strong>A Penit\u00eancia 18K<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:15), o <strong>Mini Burel 12K<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:35) e a caminhada guiada <strong>Passos do Burel<\/strong> (arranque \u00e0s 09:45). Todos os percursos oferecem trilhos t\u00e9cnicos renovados, encostas desafiantes e abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>ManteigasbyHeart<\/strong>, contando com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Manteigas<\/strong> e a coopera\u00e7\u00e3o das freguesias e associa\u00e7\u00f5es desportivas locais.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; o