ight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realizam os Trilhos do Burel 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 8 de novembro de 2026, no concelho de Manteigas, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da Serra da Estrela, distrito da Guarda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova de 33K parte \u00e0s 09:05, a de 18K \u00e0s 09:15, a de 12K \u00e0s 09:35 e a caminhada Passos do Burel arranca \u00e0s 09:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 13 de outubro), os valores s\u00e3o de 25,00 \u20ac (33K), 15,00 \u20ac (18K) e 10,00 \u20ac (12K e caminhada). A partir de 14 de outubro os valores sobem para 30,00 \u20ac, 20,00 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac, respetivamente.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova de 33 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova de 33 km disp\u00f5e de um tempo limite de 7 horas para conclus\u00e3o (encerramento \u00e0s 17:05), sendo acompanhada por atletas vassoura.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento completo pode ser consultado atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Acorrer na hiperliga\u00e7\u00e3o: https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/9630\/6a43e9494b764_Regulamento.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos do Burel 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-08\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Manteigas (Serra da Estrela)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Manteigas\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ManteigasbyHeart e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Manteigas\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realizam os Trilhos do Burel